class_name NeedleworkPalettes
extends RefCounted

## The 16 preset 16-colour palettes for original designs (`mNW_PaletteIdx2Palette`,
## `src/game/m_needlework.c:168-278`). Source values are `ARGB8_to_RGB5A3(0xFFRRGGBB)`
## — every entry is opaque, so they are stored here as 0xRRGGBB.
##
## CI index 0 (`0x525252`) is the editor's "erase" colour; `m_design_ovl` forces the
## active paint index into 1..15. It is still a real colour when a design is rendered
## onto cloth / a mannequin, so all 16 are kept.

